pixels-off-glibc: 3
The barbs are turned by Affine2D().rotate of atan2(v, u) + pi / 2, whose cos and sin (and the atan2) come from the
C library. musl (the WASM build) differs from glibc 2.44 (the references) in the last bit for some of these inputs,
which moves three antialiased pixels; the draw calls agree within 1e-12 and the SVG bytes are equal.
